	(text "08_MCU_USB_CONTROL — STM32G431RBT6 (was G431RBT6RET6 placeholder; I/O table requires 64 pins -> RBT6 LQFP64, not KBT6 LQFP32) + USB-C + SWD + watchdog + relay drivers + ENABLE" (at 9.91 7.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.254)) (justify left)))
	(text "Single continuous plane (IR-13). Digital returns via local decoupling + placement. No split." (at 9.91 11.94 0) (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left)))
	(text "Rev 0.2 Detailed Phase 7. See latch doc for ENABLE logic." (at 9.91 16.00 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)))

	; ─── Section A: MCU core ───
	(text "A — MCU: STM32G431RBT6 (was G431RBT6RET6 placeholder; I/O table requires 64 pins -> RBT6 LQFP64, not KBT6 LQFP32) LQFP64 170MHz 512KB Flash, 128KB RAM, FPU, USB FS, 5x SPI/I2C, 7x timers, IWDG/WWDG" (at 9.91 22.10 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.2))))
	(text "A1 Power / decoupling: VDDA via LC filter (10uH + 4.7uF+100nF). Each VDD pin: 100nF C0G + 4.7uF X7R close (<2mm). Bulk 10uF tantalum. VCAP pins 2.2uF. VDDA 100nF+1uF. Ferrite bead (600R@100MHz) between +3V3_DIG and VDDA only via filter, not plane split." (at 9.91 25.91 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "A2 Clock: HSE 8MHz crystal (HC49S, 18pF load, 10pF+10pF NP0). HSI16 fallback. LSE 32.768kHz optional DNP. MCO disabled. HSE drives 170MHz via PLL (8*42.5/2). Clock failure -> HSI fallback + fault flag." (at 9.91 29.97 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "A3 Reset/Boot: NRST 10k pull-up + 100nF to GND + pushbutton to GND (TP_NRST). BOOT0 10k pull-down to GND + header to 3.3V for DFU. NRST driven by supervisor (STM809) open-drain: holds low 240ms on power-up, also on watchdog timeout." (at 9.91 34.04 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "A4 SWD: SWDIO/PA13 + SWCLK/PA14 + SWO/PB3 + NRST via 10-pin Cortex 1.27mm shrouded header (TC2050 alt). Series 22R on SWD lines, 100k pull-up SWDIO, 100k pull-down SWCLK per ST app note." (at 9.91 38.10 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "A5 Watchdog: IWDG 32kHz LSI (~1s timeout) + WWDG window. MCU must pet IWDG every 500ms; failure resets MCU and supervisor also pulls POR low -> latch disables ENABLE. Heartbeat GPIO (PA8) toggles -> external AND with FAULT_LATCH ensures pet only when not latched." (at 9.91 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))

