	; ─── Section B: USB-C ───
	(text "B — USB-C (Full Speed device, CDC/TMC, 12 Mbps) — power via +5V USB, not DUT power" (at 9.91 70.10 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.2))))
	(text "Connector: USB-C 16-pin mid-mount (GCT USB4085 or Würth 632712000011). CC1/CC2 each 5.1k 1% to GND (UFP). D+/D- via USBLC6-2SC6 ESD (0.35pF, 6V clamp) + 22R series + 33pF DNP. VBUS sense via divider 10k/10k to PA9 (or 5V-tolerant). Shield to chassis via 1M||10nF + 1nF HF + 0R option. VBUS 10uF + 100nF decoupling. USB_DM/DP have internal 1.5k pull-up via STM32 USB peripheral (software-controlled)." (at 9.91 73.91 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "Isolation provision: footprint for ADuM3160+isolated DC/DC (e.g., Murata NME0505SC) DNP in REV-A — direct USB ships with ground-loop warning. Pair length matched 90R diff. Keep away from ADC/shunt region >20mm." (at 9.91 77.98 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
