	; ─── Section C: SPI/I2C to DAC/ADC + temp ───
	(text "C — SPI/I2C: SPI1 (DAC AD5764), SPI2 (ADC ADS1262), I2C1 (TMP117 x3) + relay GPIO" (at 9.91 102.11 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.2))))
	(text "SPI1: PA5 SCK 10MHz, PA6 MISO, PA7 MOSI, PA4 CS_DAC (active low, 10k pull-up). SPI2: PB13 SCK 8MHz, PB14 MISO, PB15 MOSI, PB12 CS_ADC. Both with 22R series + 100pF DNP for EMI. I2C1: PB6 SCL 400kHz, PB7 SDA + 2.2k pull-ups. DAC LDAC -> PC6, CLR -> PC7. ADC DRDY -> PA10 interrupt, START -> PA11, RESET -> PC8." (at 9.91 105.92 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
	(text "A/B SPI are on separate buses to avoid DAC/ADC contention; DMA1 Ch1 for DAC sweep ramp, DMA1 Ch2 for ADC burst. Temp sensors TMP117 @0.1C accuracy on I2C: U10 output stage, U11 shunt block, U12 reference. Address strapping 48/49/4A." (at 9.91 109.98 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
